  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate easyRPA robots with help of Camunda-based business process",
    "splashDescription": "Enhance your business process automation with the easyRPA Connector for Camunda. Seamlessly integrate easyRPA bots into your Camunda processes, automate tasks, and streamline operations. With this Connector, you can manage RPA tasks within Camunda, use BPMN for complex branching logic and error handling, and gain insights from process execution data to drive continuous improvement. This integration empowers you to orchestrate end-to-end business processes, combining the flexibility of Camunda with the efficiency of easyRPA automation.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/441798/overview/img1831499167599833305.png?b7ff6327d9f89055c4b2749155130004",
